From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000023 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hibreak <hibreak@localhost>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 23:45:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] e-ink: sleep screen fixes (hidden notifications, landscape
 sizing, footer overflow, caching)

Fixes several edge cases in EinkSleepScreen:
- Skip hidden or removed ExpandableNotificationRow children in loadIcons()
  so notifications hidden on the lock screen do not leak as sleep-screen
  icons.
- Scale numerals, date, icons, battery and footer from min(w, h) instead
  of w so locking in landscape does not overflow the screen.
- Reject non-finite weather temperatures (NaN/Infinity), ellipsize long
  weather condition tails, and omit the trailing middot separator when an
  event time leaves no room for a title.
- Cache the base Typefaces instead of calling Typeface.create() on every
  onDraw(), and unregister the StatusBarStateController callback / clear
  sInstance on detach.
---
 .../systemui/shade/EinkSleepScreen.java       | 75 +++++++++++++------
 1 file changed, 52 insertions(+), 23 deletions(-)

diff --git a/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/shade/EinkSleepScreen.java b/packages/SystemUI/src/com/android/systemui/shade/EinkSleepScreen.java
